{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "1257158e4c6456f059ea95ef6207628edd627a301a655c1dd393ea7cb8dbe8e8", "ja": "～極道～", "zh": "～黑道～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d7bde8036100f26c1c58cd0e3b59a610a01c51f360099545319d7b0e5690bdb3", "ja": "桃子は環の目の前で、木下組に拐われてしま\nう。余計な事を考えるなと、ひなたは桃子を\n脅す。途中、足を捻ったという桃子をのり子\nが背負う。昔はよくこうして遊んだと呟く桃\n子に、そんな事もあったね、と返すのり子。", "zh": "桃子在环的面前被木下组拐走\n了。日向威胁桃子，让她别想多\n余的事。途中，桃子说自己的脚扭\n到了，典子便背起了她。桃子喃喃说\n以前经常这样一起玩，典子回应道：\n“以前确实有过这样的事呢。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "07152e315b2c40f7db8275d5dc14cc2b14073788a6cd88f2f260ff894c269e51", "ja": "お嬢、お嬢～！　迎えにきたぞ！\n一緒に帰ろう～……おろ？", "zh": "大小姐，大小姐～！我来接你啦！一起回去吧～……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "c72d912806453dc67499406934bb4a684498e79b552c08c90e28133391734f7d", "ja": "もう、いちいちうるさい。\n毎日迎えに来なくてもいいって言ってるでしょ。", "zh": "真是的，别一遍遍地吵了。\n都说了不用每天来接我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fdf7eb685eb9e41e93bfa02a4dc20ca86a2483c8c0d0460f0f37cae8be1e2c3", "ja": "ダメ！　お嬢は魅梨音組の大事な跡取りなんだから。\nお嬢が継ぐって聞いて、こぶんも戻ってきたんだよ。", "zh": "不行！大小姐可是魅梨音组重要的继承人。\n听说大小姐要继承家业，小弟们也都回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1003_se", "source_sha256": "a8c4f85915bc34c04986ca5764c728d5a015172c5f1de292a07b1529e8435a44", "ja": "プップー", "zh": "叭叭", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "351a88879ffd73b922d1b17a1d0df174f6e4e57e4315fa1937de291fb65ad562", "ja": "やぁ、お嬢ちゃん。また会ったねぇ。\nそれじゃ、一緒に来てもらうよぉ。", "zh": "哎呀，小姑娘。又见面啦。\n那么，就请你跟我走一趟吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "f2c4b6b7cf2dd27b8474f4ec73c6fb1d1a1b21316eb808e8bef4b203151c0b11", "ja": "え？　……きゃあっ！", "zh": "诶？……呀啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "1a3c389a99e20def2369adf0543e99a46583baa82f2e5d71b45f43a2a8a1e451", "ja": "ああっ、お嬢！？　た、大変だ！　\nお嬢が、木下組にさらわれちゃった……！", "zh": "啊啊，大小姐！？不、不好了！\n大小姐被木下组给掳走了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "41de612cd484214875ffdfe16b717f5d7dfa501f334df608abcbc637ea1ae8c9", "ja": "ひなた……。のり子も。", "zh": "小日向……还有典子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "30f4b41cb808a14b7be7ecb707ef2936c1dec3ac3c38187e1019030cd7c5fa75", "ja": "のり子さんは、ただの運転手さ。\n魅梨音組ともいろいろあったらしいけんど……。", "zh": "在我看来，诺里子女士不过是个司机罢了。\n不过，听说她和魅梨音组之间也发生过不少事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "aa095fbccf0e0e18399e00b78f517c2b206550777d0194fb00caf8a0611bb43b", "ja": "用がないなら帰して。環が待ってるの。", "zh": "没事的话就让我回去。环还在等我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "5c0f0e51c708a9088cfdc1d00e9a7ad4cf4228a6c82f91b0fadf0d04587fe0da", "ja": "簡単には帰さないねぇ。お嬢ちゃんが余計な事を\n考えるから、こういう事になるんだべさ。", "zh": "可没那么容易放你回去。都是因为你这小姑娘要多管闲事，才会变成这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "8a497d539f85a839153c7243b12e12b5f7545d75c9d21abee84fb055e82087ba", "ja": "わかるべさ。お嬢ちゃんが組長になったら、\n街の、み～んなが困るんだよぉ。", "zh": "明白的吧。大小姐要是成了老大，\n镇上的大家～都会很伤脑筋的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "20710465cb19241c57d2a35eb6a61ba76ddc97ee314f081ddbbbeadb02b3913d", "ja": "困るって誰が？\nあなたと、あなたのお金が大好きな人達でしょ？", "zh": "困扰的到底是谁？\n是你，还有那些喜欢你的钱的人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "4e7747e782457562d8fdebb4dec3ccc8344a7dea4fef5a6cc4eca1a3a3f099af", "ja": "それが資本主義ってもんだからねぇ。これからの時代、\nものを言うのは任俠道でも、腕っ節でもないんだ。", "zh": "这就是所谓的资本主义嘛。今后的时代，\n能说了算的既不是侠义道，也不是蛮力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "7f8b614a721e5c5604f673f9f47d23b092d988b4258d1330961b0182b638fd00", "ja": "銭さ。銭を持ってる奴が強いんだ。だから銭を\n持ってない奴らは、ただ食い物にされるしかないんさ。", "zh": "就是钱。手里有钱的人才是强者。所以没钱的人，只能任人宰割了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "9aa6785a8277b7893f9ab4c29c092ae788ac4682f7a66ad2c066ac18cd20374e", "ja": "どうせ一から出直しなんだ。だったらお嬢ちゃんは、\nカタギとしてやり直したほうがいいんでないかい？", "zh": "反正都得从头再来。那你还不如作为普通人重新开始，不是更好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "75600cd76fe8785372cb4c3173d5cb60d7207a98e8a727283ed38efa912a9fb3", "ja": "あなたも、あの人と同じことを言うのね……。", "zh": "你也要说和那个人一样的话吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "a3b2974980104032fc3b6f12bba549fbe51b495e283c30cf7b88c84be7532796", "ja": "へえ？　誰だか知らないが、お嬢ちゃんにも\n賢いお友達がいるんだねぇ。", "zh": "哦？虽然不知道那个人是谁，但小姑娘也有聪明的朋友嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "530f0606a4fdb145e916d67c3543209da3accfeff2c1f4c11739e974277131ac", "ja": "おや。どうしたんだい？", "zh": "哎呀，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1020_049mom", "source_sha256": "a5ccdf515fdb1f7732eff50f80b3de7a5ea2c777602fc1137f6b3befb60dfe26", "ja": "さっき、無理やり連れてこられた時、\n足をひねったみたい。痛くて歩けない。", "zh": "刚才被强行带过来的时候，好像扭到脚了。疼得走不了路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "d7af3f4ba50348db9051109648d3cbc0c15195c3b7f2b631195474c1921f8cb1", "ja": "歩けない？　それじゃぁ仕方ないねぇ……\nのり子さん！", "zh": "不能走路？那就没办法了呢……\n纪子小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "44387117171119fd169c814314de4d55dfc608bfd48e295bdff23afee41bb2f9", "ja": "ああ。\n……だいぶ腫れてるな。歩けそうか？", "zh": "啊。\n……肿得挺厉害的。还能走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "5816cdf8ce59d73367f4f79b2edc8e5ea482c5c0b3681e6c1747e0c874995b79", "ja": "無理。", "zh": "不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "83c6e6b162b8e1655bb440b60add5c018f5c201d71d46c08826ca94f82034ba8", "ja": "……。はい。\nおぶさって。背中に。", "zh": "……好。背我。到背上来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "9ff8ccfe6608b5c1e8613c4c25c84b6ea4c4dd2b945fe1ebe040f8cd8a0c6921", "ja": "歩けないなら、こうする他ないだろ。", "zh": "走不动的话，也只能这样了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "85bbd29fb6dcdce606c96600f14eaeeda54409755c46bc1354ca5aa34fbbaeff", "ja": "……。\n昔は、よくこうやって遊んだね。", "zh": "……。\n以前，我们也经常像这样一起玩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "7bbe7a6080b763e1735a6a4c60eb2347859e4e05a1155dc1f1a47b1c9a2c39b8", "ja": "ああ。そんなこともあったね。", "zh": "啊。以前也有过那样的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0117_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0117_story_05_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "bce02c99d9bfd3ce9315c8bb8962d9cd06f5e5976c1b4fbeaffef270e889a89e", "ja": "覚えてたんだ……。\n覚えてたのに……どうして……。", "zh": "你还记得啊……。\n记得的话……为什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
